            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Nurses may be at increased risk of non-communicable diseases such as cancer and asthma because of their exposure to hazardous substances in the workplace. Environmental and health groups are working together to persuade hospitals to adopt green practices that are better for the planet and safer for healthcare staff.</AbstractText>
